sequenceDiagram
  actor Engineer
  participant API
  participant Source as ERP / Bank / FX
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Engineer->>API: Run incremental ETL
  API->>DB: Acquire advisory lock and read checkpoints
  API->>Source: Read paged deliveries after cursor
  API->>DB: Append raw revisions and quality issues
  API->>DB: Rebuild typed facts from latest valid revisions
  alt publication succeeds
    API->>DB: Commit facts, run and checkpoints
  else storage or injected failure
    API->>DB: Roll back and write failed run separately
  end
  API-->>Engineer: Run and correlation ID
